  "content": "<p>&nbsp;</p><h2><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><span><span><span>本材质包提供两种外观选项：标准版与连接版。</span></span></span></strong></span></em></span></h2><p>&nbsp;</p><ol>\n<li>\n<h3><strong><span><span><span>材质美化参考来源：&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/cozyui\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\">CozyUI+</span></a>，请搭配对应材质包使用。<br></span></span></span></strong></h3>\n</li>\n<li>\n<h3><strong><span><span><span>适用版本：<span style=\"color:#e67e23\">neoforge 1.21.x<span style=\"color:#fff\">，</span></span>其他版本请自行测试并反馈结果。<br></span></span></span></strong></h3>\n</li>\n<li>\n<h3><strong><span><span><span>本材质包遵循GPL-3.0开源协议，需要源文件可联系作者获取。</span></span></span></strong></h3>\n</li>\n</ol><p>&nbsp;</p><ul>\n<li><strong><span><span><span>对应模组：<span style=\"color:#fbeeb8\"><a style=\"color:#fbeeb8\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sophisticated-backpacks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sophisticated Backpacks</a></span></span></span></span></strong></li>\n<li><strong><span><span><span>推荐搭配材质包</span></span></span></strong><strong>：<span><span><span><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\"><a style=\"color:#c2e0f4\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/cozyui\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CozyUI+</a></span></span></span></span></strong></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><strong><span><span><span>本包基于：<span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><a style=\"color:#f1c40f\" href=\"https://github.com/Fogg05/CozyUI-Plus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CozyUI-plus</a></span></span></span></span></strong></span></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p>",
